[{"id":165796492,"discussion_id":"38ca1ab8362dea31df5405f1215d2278af71a8b7","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*chaotang233*](https://gitcode.com/chaotang233), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*chaotang233*](https://gitcode.com/chaotang233), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n wmg1, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-19T20:09:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-20T18:29:31+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165796527,"discussion_id":"5de4b894343d425a06ddf2329df695ed0e7d284d","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-19T20:09:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T20:09:12+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165796925,"discussion_id":"1713cff2b77301b2b9abf04f168c54294495fa4f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在修复量化批处理矩阵乘法算子及其内核中的多个关键缺陷，以提升代码健壮性、确保计算正确性并防止资源泄漏。主要修复包括：1）修复了算子初始化函数中管道对象 `pipe_` 的赋值顺序错误，避免了因使用未初始化变量而导致的未定义行为；2）更正了内核中硬件事件类型枚举值的使用错误，确保硬件流水线同步逻辑的正确性；3）修复了内核工作空间偏移的计算错误，防止了潜在的内存访问越界或数据错位；4）修复了内核中释放硬件事件ID时的索引错误，避免了事件资源泄漏。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案聚焦于代码逻辑修正，不涉及新增功能或外部接口变更。具体包括：1）将 `QuantBatchMatmulV4Msd` 类 `Init` 函数中的 `pipe_ = tPipe;` 语句提前执行，确保后续对象初始化时管道对象已有效赋值；2）将内核 `InitEventIds` 函数中 `mte2WaitVEventIds_` 数组的初始化值从 `HardEvent::MTE2_V` 统一更正为 `HardEvent::V_MTE2`；3）将内核 `InitGlobalBuffer` 函数中 `workspaceCGlobal_` 缓冲区的偏移量计算更正为 `workspace + aUnfoldSize + atomicAddSize * sizeof(float) + 2 * reduceSumSize`；4）将内核 `ProcessC1C2PerGroup` 函数中释放事件的索引从 `eventIdsVToMte2[0]` 更正为 `eventIdsVToMte2[1]`。所有修改均旨在消除潜在风险，保证内核在异构计算架构下的正确、稳定执行。","created_at":"2026-03-19T20:10:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T20:10:54+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165800150,"discussion_id":"0ea7d46af01060aa8b5c1d2feff91a93c8af58be","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-19T20:26:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-19T20:26:46+08:00","user":{"id":"67409af2bbb79f75221ca38c","login":"wmg1","object_id":"67409af2bbb79f75221ca38c","name":"wmg1","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ca/ad/c833aa5d6dc524d19ab57c829b91a616bae128f83c49dbb9aef5a64f58b57c4e.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wmg